'''Kuromi''' (クロミ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kuromi
|image = E 239.png
|appearance = [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 150円 - 592円
}}

==Enemy==
Kuromi is a black kitten with bright yellow eyes. This enemy has fairly low damage and range, plus a single target multi-hit. It isn't much of a threat due to these attributes.

==Strategy==
As Kuromi is Single Target, it doesn't pose a huge threat to your cats. You can easily take it down using high DPS, spammable cats such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] combined with some meatshields to defeat it.

